WEBVTT

00:00:00.910 --> 00:00:04.440
<i>These coords are not for those
who are undeserving to wear them.</i>

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:07.570
<i>I won't let you!</i>

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:08.610
<i>How dare he!</i>

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.510
Go.

00:00:17.340 --> 00:00:21.390
One of these days I'll get them back,

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:26.420
and force the wrongdoer to regret it!

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:30.750
Hibiki-sama,

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.550
is placing the Summer Dream Coords on this pillar to your liking?

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.180
Yes.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.440
They'll come in handy in my future negotiations,

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.680
so it'd be best to protect them.

00:00:41.680 --> 00:00:43.430
The day's starting out well.

00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.520
And a good day for you.

00:02:23.060 --> 00:02:24.930
Shion vs Hibiki.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:30.200
Eh?

00:02:30.200 --> 00:02:32.250
That restaurant's also your house, Dorothy?

00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.130
It's just like my house.

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:37.590
However, our Okonomiyaki restaurant is the best!

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:39.550
Pushuu~?

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:44.250
The Parajuku Fireworks Festival is happening along the Parajuku River tomorrow.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:47.430
Then we should go see the fireworks together!

00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:48.560
I'm sure it'll be fun!

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.520
What kind of yukata should I wear?

00:02:54.520 --> 00:02:56.760
You're all so carefree.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:03:00.530
You're going to be helping our restaurant out tomorrow, right, Shion?

00:03:01.170 --> 00:03:02.990
I don't mind...

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:05.280
Who's there?!

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:08.370
Oh!

00:03:08.370 --> 00:03:09.960
It's Shikyouin's sheep!

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.990
Butler!

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:17.540
For me?

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:28.180
My heart, which has been thinking of you, is but a single swan that has wandered from the flock...

00:03:28.180 --> 00:03:30.480
...and no longer has a place to return to.

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.600
I'll be waiting for you in Parajuku Park at 4PM.

00:03:35.510 --> 00:03:37.010
Could this be...

00:03:37.010 --> 00:03:38.510
It could be...

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.890
Let's see...

00:03:46.890 --> 00:03:50.600
<i>I want you to be my wings.</i>

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.990
<i>That is to say, I would like to go on a date.</i>

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.700
<i>- Shikyouin Hibiki</i>

00:03:55.590 --> 00:03:57.180
T-This is...

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.320
A date invitation?!

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.970
And from Shikyouin?!

00:04:01.490 --> 00:04:04.180
Shion-san as wings?

00:04:04.840 --> 00:04:07.460
Something like white and black?!

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:11.030
That'd be like some kind of Aloma and Mikan mixture!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:12.200
How silly!

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:14.150
This is why you're still a primary schooler.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:18.240
Paprika Private Academy rule number 387:

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.940
"Don't make fun of those who don't know any better!"

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.720
You should be a role model!

00:04:24.520 --> 00:04:27.290
This is a love letter.

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:28.520
You know...

00:04:28.520 --> 00:04:31.820
One of those letters where you confess your love.

00:04:31.820 --> 00:04:32.970
Eh?!

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.120
And Shion-san got one from Shikyouin-san?!

00:04:35.410 --> 00:04:37.590
A-Are you going to meet him, Shion?

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:38.860
Huh?

00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.780
Shion?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:40.800
Where'd she go?

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.080
Did she...

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:43.690
She went on the date!

00:04:43.690 --> 00:04:44.260
Eh?!

00:04:58.150 --> 00:04:59.320
Found her!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:01.270
She made a swift decision, huh?

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:04.120
And their date is going to start after this?!

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.000
That's a surprise even from Shion.

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:10.430
Maybe Shikyouin-san is going to have Shion take Fuwari's place as princess?

00:05:10.430 --> 00:05:11.660
No way.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:14.160
Shion doesn't fit the image of a princess at all.

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:17.980
This is the first time I've seen a date first hand!

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.280
What does one do on a date?

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:22.490
W-Well...

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:26.220
The two of them go out together and have fun.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.830
Go out together?

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:29.370
<i>Go!</i>

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:30.890
Gon! Go-Gon!

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:34.810
Peck! Peck! Peck! Peck!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.600
<i>It seems that Sophie may have forgotten,</i>

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:46.180
<i>but there's no mistaking that the acting principal was involved in that incident.</i>

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.340
<i>And now there's this love letter...</i>

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:51.950
<i>What is he up to?</i>

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:55.000
<i>But he's not acting like a normal deceitful guy...</i>

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:00.400
He's coming.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:01.880
Eh? Where is he?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:12.220
Hold on to me tight!

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:12.850
Or you'll fall!

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.490
Shion-san!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:25.760
You made quite the violent entrance, didn't you?
It's Shikyouin Hibiki-san!

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:26.830
Where? Where?!

00:06:26.830 --> 00:06:28.990
That's cause I heard you're the forceful type.
He's here next to us!

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:29.490
Wow, it is!

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:29.850
See them?

00:06:29.850 --> 00:06:30.180
Indeed.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:31.400
Who is she?!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:31.950
Wow! So beautiful!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:32.840
Wow, look, it's Hibiki-san!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:35.540
Let's go somewhere where we can be alone.

00:06:35.540 --> 00:06:37.750
Then let's go to my house.

00:06:38.910 --> 00:06:40.540
That's pretty bold of you.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:42.630
We don't have time to waste.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:44.210
Let's Go!

00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:46.210
It would be best if you stopped saying that.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:47.670
I refuse.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:53.880
I guess I'll overlook that because it's you.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:55.270
Though in the strictest sense,

00:06:55.270 --> 00:06:56.960
it's not a sentence ender.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.680
What are you talking about?

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:04.380
Hold on a minute!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:07.110
If they keep going, they'll end up at Shion's place!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.570
Shion's more daring than I thought!

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:12.610
PriPara code number 49:

00:07:12.610 --> 00:07:16.870
"Idol's male-female relationships must be wholesome"!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.660
Let's hurry!

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.230
I'm not sure what's going on,

00:07:21.230 --> 00:07:22.350
but capisce!

00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:26.590
Now then, let's get started.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:29.010
Here?

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:30.080
Now strip!

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:35.930
Hibiki-sama only makes time
for those who are smart.

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.820
But we're here to see Shion!

00:07:38.820 --> 00:07:40.690
This is Shion's house!

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:45.150
However, Hibiki-sama is on the other side of this door right now.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:47.900
Could any of you read this?

00:07:48.510 --> 00:07:50.110
Sure thing!

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:57.810
This is a high school level classical Chinese textbook...

00:07:57.810 --> 00:07:59.830
There's no way we'd be able to read this!

00:08:00.940 --> 00:08:03.190
"The 16th year of King Keibun"

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.790
Wait, you can read it?!

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:12.970
<i>Lien Po was an able general of Chao who commanded the army against Chi and defeated its troops, taking the city of Yangsin.</i>

00:08:12.970 --> 00:08:18.280
<i>Then he was made a chief minister and was known for his prowess to all the states.</i>

00:08:19.110 --> 00:08:20.560
Will that suffice?

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:22.520
You pass.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.370
That's amazing, Prez!

00:08:24.370 --> 00:08:26.130
Clap clap!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:29.230
It's not that hard if you know the symbols and tricks to it.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.440
Now you'll let us through?!

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:32.800
No.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.780
Why?!

00:08:39.650 --> 00:08:43.330
Hibiki-sama only makes time for those who are athletic.

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:48.040
Now then, I'll let you pass if you score even once.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:49.880
Eh?!

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:51.510
Stop screwing around with us!

00:08:55.590 --> 00:08:57.090
Impressive...

00:08:57.690 --> 00:09:01.960
While we're doing this, Shion and Shikyouin-sama are...

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:10.020
My my.

00:09:10.410 --> 00:09:13.470
There seems to be a misunderstanding here.

00:09:13.470 --> 00:09:14.750
What misunderstanding?

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.280
It must be this!

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.360
You're too sure of yourself!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.570
Head!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:24.370
Do continue.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:29.750
Throw!

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:31.370
Of one mind!

00:09:35.950 --> 00:09:37.550
Now it's my turn, right?

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:42.970
Perseverance!

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:46.800
Yes.

00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:49.430
Show me more, Toudou Shion.

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.570
I want to know more about you.

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:54.190
That's what that challenge was about?

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:56.040
Challenge?

00:09:56.040 --> 00:09:59.410
Inviting me to a specific place at a specific time can be nothing other than a challenge.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.830
It seems you lead a fairly strange life.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.670
May the best player win.

00:10:13.490 --> 00:10:14.760
Love letter?

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:17.970
What's that?

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:23.430
I suppose you could call it a letter asking about the black and white of your heart.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:25.180
I've taken an interest in you.

00:10:26.420 --> 00:10:28.530
Would you mind lending me your power?

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:31.190
Unfortunately I'm not interested.

00:10:31.900 --> 00:10:35.150
I have things to do with the girls I do PriPara with.

00:10:35.690 --> 00:10:37.110
Take this!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:40.990
Form a team,

00:10:40.990 --> 00:10:43.380
participate in the Autumn Dream Idol GrandPrix,

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:43.950
and emerge victorious.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:44.840
Pushuu~!

00:10:44.840 --> 00:10:46.410
That is my current goal.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:51.580
There's also recovering the Summer Dream Coords that were stolen from us!

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.030
Let's use our secret move!

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:57.510
Ninja Monja Twin Shoot!

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:04.790
After all, it's an important coord that was given to us.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:14.600
And we were finally getting to the good part.

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:16.280
Do not worry.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:17.340
Go! Go!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.110
Gogogogogo!

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:19.800
Go! Go!

00:11:19.800 --> 00:11:23.280
Gogogogogo!

00:11:26.020 --> 00:11:27.540
And we're back to where we were.

00:11:28.460 --> 00:11:30.000
It's exactly as I expected...

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.460
Toudou Shion, you are a true prodigy.

00:11:47.690 --> 00:11:48.810
What's with you?!

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:51.270
It was a kiss of respect.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:57.470
To be honest, I already know a lot about you.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:02.180
You can memorise a song or dance after only seeing it once.

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:04.820
Your tune,

00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:07.420
Making Drama,

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.040
stage outfits,

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:11.500
and your idol ranking...

00:12:16.160 --> 00:12:17.540
What on earth...

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.050
There are other things I know.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:23.760
Including something you've forgotten.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.300
Something I forgot?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.430
And what you'll be in the future...

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:33.440
If you want to know, tomorrow...

00:12:38.040 --> 00:12:40.780
Andou, my business here is done.

00:12:40.780 --> 00:12:41.440
I'm leaving.

00:12:43.900 --> 00:12:45.160
Hold on.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.620
Why did you invite Shion out?

00:12:49.170 --> 00:12:50.570
Love lettuce.

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.090
Shion-san?

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:00.460
Well?! How'd it go?!

00:13:00.460 --> 00:13:03.830
Tell us about your first date.

00:13:03.830 --> 00:13:05.800
Date? What's that?

00:13:08.070 --> 00:13:10.050
We were evenly matched.

00:13:10.050 --> 00:13:11.520
He was quite the opponent.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:16.440
Then it wasn't a date...

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:21.080
Wow! Awesome!

00:13:40.110 --> 00:13:42.480
One sausage okonomiyaki!

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:44.470
One Hiroshima-style okonomiyaki please.

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:46.270
Yes, one moment.

00:13:46.270 --> 00:13:48.120
Man, what happened to Shion?!

00:13:48.120 --> 00:13:50.400
She promised to help out at our stall!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:52.130
What's she off doing?!

00:13:52.130 --> 00:13:54.980
Maybe she got lost in the crowd.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:02.400
<i>There are other things I know.</i>

00:14:03.030 --> 00:14:05.440
<i>...something you've forgotten.</i>

00:14:05.440 --> 00:14:07.820
<i>And what you'll be in the future...</i>

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.000
Hey, I see you came.

00:14:23.460 --> 00:14:26.480
What have I forgotten?

00:14:26.480 --> 00:14:27.720
Come aboard.

00:14:41.090 --> 00:14:42.110
Take a look.

00:14:44.440 --> 00:14:47.260
It's like we're flying above the stars.

00:14:47.260 --> 00:14:50.070
And the people are nothing more than dust.

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:52.530
I-It's...

00:14:55.390 --> 00:14:56.700
I can see it!

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:59.000
The idol teams shine on the Go board.

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.630
I see you've noticed.

00:15:02.310 --> 00:15:06.210
You girls are nothing but single stones placed upon the board.

00:15:06.970 --> 00:15:11.180
But I believe you have the ability to control that board.

00:15:11.180 --> 00:15:12.960
I do?

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:18.150
I don't understand why you've decided to stay at the rank you are.

00:15:19.380 --> 00:15:20.850
Back to square one.

00:15:22.910 --> 00:15:25.020
Why did you become an idol?

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.740
I...

00:15:30.140 --> 00:15:32.840
<i>Speed is the essence of war!</i>

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.450
<i>I'll start by defeating those three!</i>

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.910
<i>Shion will Go to war!</i>

00:15:41.530 --> 00:15:42.730
That's right.

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.570
I vowed to defeat SoLaMi Smile...

00:15:45.570 --> 00:15:48.880
...but now we're competing as friends.

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:51.090
Return to the battlefield.

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.800
That's right.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:56.890
Weren't you aiming to become a Divine Idol?

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.270
You're right, I...

00:16:01.210 --> 00:16:03.280
Continuing like this will get you nowhere.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:07.480
How can you evolve and obtain a glorious future?

00:16:08.240 --> 00:16:10.570
You understand, don't you, Toudou Shion?

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:15.660
Usa?

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:18.380
You want to do a solo concert-usa?

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:19.580
What's with that?!

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:20.820
What about Leona and myself?!

00:16:20.820 --> 00:16:23.040
Are you quitting your team?

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:24.820
Is there something you don't like?

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:28.670
Are you not happy being in a team with me?

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.080
That's not it.

00:16:30.080 --> 00:16:33.130
I can perform with Dressing Pafé any time.

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:37.900
I've never performed a solo concert like Sophie.

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:41.420
I want to find out how far I can go on my own.

00:16:41.420 --> 00:16:42.090
I see.

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:44.980
As expected of Shion. Always looking up-usa.

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:49.840
By increasing your individual strengths you also strengthen the team-usa.

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.610
I'll go along with it-usa.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.890
If that's the reason...

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:57.220
Besides, I'd love to see your solo concert.

00:16:58.100 --> 00:17:01.580
If you're both okay with it, go for it.

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:10.210
Your new song has arrived-usa!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:14.830
So you're entering on your own, Shion-san?

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:16.810
This is the first time you've done a solo.

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.430
Good luck!

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:24.230
Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:26.940
Coord Change Start!

00:17:27.650 --> 00:17:30.330
Since it's punk, we'll go with the Hard Eternal Punk Coord.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:34.920
But per Shion's request, PriPara has remade it with just black and white shades.

00:17:34.920 --> 00:17:37.830
Eternal Black or White Coord!

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:38.800
Go!

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.880
We've been waiting for your solo!

00:17:44.880 --> 00:17:46.840
Good luck, Shion!

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:48.420
You're so cool, Shion!

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.340
Shion!

00:17:51.010 --> 00:17:52.380
Shion!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.500
<i>Back to square one.</i>

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.240
<i>Return to the battlefield.</i>

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:06.090
<i>I'll hone my sword,</i>

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:08.350
<i>and aim to be a Divine Idol!</i>

00:19:27.120 --> 00:19:28.230
Go!

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:31.400
Making Drama Switch On!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:36.400
Rockin' Rockin' Rock-n-Roll!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:40.900
Go!

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:43.490
That's right!

00:19:46.460 --> 00:19:49.910
Rockin' Jet Show On Air!

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:53.760
Cyalume Change!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:19:58.300
Go Uncompromising Life-form!

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.470
You got it!

00:19:59.470 --> 00:20:00.920
Go!

00:20:42.690 --> 00:20:44.440
You got a lot of likes!

00:20:44.440 --> 00:20:48.750
Shion-san has ranked up to the Major Class's Famous Idol.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.020
Congratulations.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:57.490
Shion is so cool!

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:59.180
This isn't our normal Shion!

00:20:59.180 --> 00:21:00.940
We can't let our guard down-pri.

00:21:03.920 --> 00:21:06.130
That was wonderful, Shion.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:09.870
W-Well, I suppose that was better than I expected.

00:21:10.310 --> 00:21:13.520
Now the two of us will need to put on a concert!

00:21:13.520 --> 00:21:15.340
We're steadily getting there-usa!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:19.090
One by one we'll level up to Top Idol-usa.

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.050
Let's aim to be...

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:22.720
...Divine Idols together!

00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:34.140
Now then, who's next?

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:09.330
PriPara's rhythm is offbeat because of that Phantom Thief Genius-pri!

00:23:09.330 --> 00:23:13.830
Then why don't we have an event to get everyone energized?!

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:14.600
Next time:

00:23:14.600 --> 00:23:16.540
Friend Tickets Save the World

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:17.800
Aim for your dreams!

00:23:17.800 --> 00:23:19.660
Let's go PriPara!
